{
  "id": "color-contrast",
  "term": "color contrast",
  "definition": "Color contrast is a difference in color between an object and other items in a visual scene that can make the object easier to pick out and identify. In referential communication, speakers may mention color to take advantage of this contrast even when color is not strictly needed to single out the object.",
